NOTE:
--------------------------------------
This repository is a working area for development of custom pads for
IHP SG13CMOS5L.

Specifically, the first Chipalooza challenge identified the issue
that some designs have 1.2V I/O signals, and for the purposes of a
test chip, these signals need to be brought out to a padframe.  The
existing analog pad has ESD diodes connected to the IOVDD 3.3V
supply which then does not protect those signals from voltages
high enough to destroy the circuit.  So a new analog pad needs to be
designed which connects ESD p-side diodes to the VDD (1.2V) bus for
both primary and secondary lines.
